 ystify how to make dovetails completely by hand. The first day will be spe
 nt cutting dovetails and pins and the second day will be dedicated to fitt
 ing joinery and constructing your project. This class is geared toward peo
 ple who have beginner woodworking skills and want to learn more advanced t
 echniques\, but students new to the woodshop are also welcome to join!
